<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="csrf-token" content={get_csrf_token()} />
    <.live_title default="雀馆 Mahjong" suffix="" phx-no-format>{assigns[:page_title]}</.live_title>
    <meta property="og:title" content="雀馆 Mahjong" />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="链接即入局 · 四人同桌 · 缺位由 AI 补齐的在线麻将房"
    />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://mahjong.gonglexin.com/images/og-image.png" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="雀馆 Mahjong" />
    <meta
      name="twitter:description"
      content="链接即入局 · 四人同桌 · 缺位由 AI 补齐的在线麻将房"
    />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://mahjong.gonglexin.com/images/og-image.png" />
    <link phx-track-static rel="stylesheet" href={~p"/assets/css/app.css"} />
    <script defer phx-track-static type="text/javascript" src={~p"/assets/js/app.js"}>
    </script>
    <script type="module">
      import { minidenticonSvg } from 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/minidenticons@4.2.1/minidenticons.min.js'
    </script>
    {Application.get_env(:live_debugger, :live_debugger_tags)}
  </head>
  <body>
    <!--
      DESIGN CONTRACT · 沪上牌馆 Shanghai Deco Mahjong Parlor · seed 5c41a169 · code-led
      THESIS: a 1930s Shanghai mahjong parlor's material system — lacquer black, jade,
      brass, bone — flattened to hairlines and geometry; it refuses the casino green-felt
      and gold-emboss defaults of digital mahjong.
      OWN-WORLD: lacquer near-black ground; jade marks only the living state (turn,
      available actions); 1px brass hairlines carry every interactive surface; bone white
      belongs to tile faces; vermilion appears only on the win seal. No texture, no
      emboss; gradients exist only as material light, never decoration.
      FIRST VIEWPORT: one full-viewport lacquer table; the hand lies below as bone
      plates; the center compass is a minimal deco sunburst with wind seats and a
      tabular wall count; whose turn it is must read from brightness alone.
      SIGNATURE: a discard lands with a settle — rise, drop, shadow tightening; claim
      buttons (碰/杠/吃/胡) are engraved bone plates.
      REACH: the four tokens and the double-hairline frame unify hall and game.
      RISK: deco overreach becomes casino relief; all ornament stays 1px geometry.
    -->
    {@inner_content}
  </body>
</html>
